  "bio": "Welcome to Barham Williams' Tattoo Haven, an inimitable studio nestled in the artistic heart of Richmond, where the flourish of nature meets bold contemporary design. Specializing in intricate floral motifs and the vibrant hues of neotraditional art, our skilled artisans transform skin into canvases of living art. Book your session at Info@26swordstattoo.com and embark on a journey of self-expression where each stroke is a testament to your individuality.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Richmond, Virginia, United States\n\nBARHAMTATTOOSBOOKING@GMAIL.COM TO SET UP AN APPOINTMENT. NO DMS FOR TATTOOING.",
